cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the released audit tables, please cite the paper below."
title: "tracking-provenance-audit: post-processing provenance and estimand eligibility in multi-object tracking evaluation"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation and released audit artifacts for an evaluation audit of
  multi-object tracking submissions. The audit separates what a tracker observed
  from what post-processing synthesized before submission, classifies each
  synthesized row against a frozen reference-semantic admission rule, reports the
  full pairwise ordering of deployments at both states, and records which
  benchmark cells have an available estimand at all.
type: software
